  "html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #222222; font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;PingFang SC&quot;,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; letter-spacing: 0.5px; overflow-wrap: anywhere\"><section><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">文章的第一眼，决定读者愿不愿意停下来。好排版让观点先被看见，再让细节慢慢展开。</p><h2 title=\"从标题开始，建立阅读节奏\" style=\"margin: 32px 0 24px; color: #bb3326; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere\">01</h2><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700; color: inherit\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"margin: 24px 0; padding: 0; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75\"><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p><h2 title=\"三个可以马上检查的地方\" style=\"margin: 32px 0 24px; color: #bb3326; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere\">02</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; padding-left: 24px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.75\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.75\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 10px; line-height: 1.75\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><table style=\"width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 15px\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; word-break: break-word\">检查项</th><th style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; word-break: break-word\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #dddddd; padding: 10px; word-break: break-word\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 title=\"把风格落实到每一个细节\" style=\"margin: 32px 0 24px; color: #bb3326; font-size: 50px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; overflow-wrap: anywhere\">03</h2><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; color: #222222; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section>"
}
